# A shell script with CRLF endings fails under `sh` with "Illegal option" and "not found".
# Normalising it in the repository is the fix; the entry is what makes `git checkout`
# produce LF on every platform.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Keep the rest as-is: the toolchain reads JSON and TypeScript with either ending, and
# forcing LF everywhere would rewrite every file in the repository for no benefit.
*.ts text
*.json text
*.md text
